msgctxt "steamCache"
msgid "Reset Steam cache"
msgstr "Restablecer caché de Steam"

msgctxt "steamCache"
msgid "Use this if Rai Pal is showing games you don't actually own on Steam. This will reset Steam's cache, and then you'll have to restart Steam. You'll get an error if the file has already been deleted."
msgstr "Usa esto si Rai Pal está mostrando juegos que no posees realmente en Steam. Esto restablecerá la caché de Steam, y luego tendrás que reiniciar Steam. Recibirás un error si el archivo ya ha sido eliminado."

msgctxt "steamCache"
msgid "The cache file has been deleted. Please restart Steam, wait a few seconds, and then press the refresh button on Rai Pal."
msgstr "El archivo de caché ha sido eliminado. Por favor, reinicia Steam, espera unos segundos y luego presiona el botón de actualizar en Rai Pal."

